{
  "version": 1,
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "source": "# Lesson 9: Flags Deep Dive\n\nFlags control conditional behavior. This lesson covers the carry flag, overflow flag, and how `ADC`/`SBB` extend arithmetic across multiple words."
    },
    {
      "id": "code-1",
      "kind": "code",
      "source": ".DATA\nval1 DW 0xFFFF\nval2 DW 0x0002\n\n.CODE\n; Add two 16-bit values: 0xFFFF + 0x0002 = 0x10001\nMOV AX, val1\nADD AX, val2   ; AX = 0x0001, CF = 1 (carry out)\nHLT\n; @expect AX = 0x0001\n; @expect CF = 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-2",
      "kind": "code",
      "source": ".DATA\na_lo DW 0x8000\na_hi DW 0x0001\nb_lo DW 0x8001\nb_hi DW 0x0000\n\n.CODE\n; 32-bit add: 0x00018000 + 0x00008001 = 0x00020001\n; Low word\nMOV AX, a_lo\nADD AX, b_lo   ; AX = 0x0001, CF = 1\nMOV DX, AX     ; DX = low result\n\n; High word with carry\nMOV AX, a_hi\nADC AX, b_hi   ; AX = 0x0001 + 0x0000 + 1(carry) = 0x0002\nHLT\n; @expect AX = 0x0002\n; @expect DX = 0x0001"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-3",
      "kind": "code",
      "source": ".DATA\nbig DW 0x0000\nsmall DW 0x0001\n\n.CODE\n; Subtraction with borrow: SBB\nMOV AX, big\nSUB AX, small  ; AX = 0xFFFF, CF = 1 (borrow)\nHLT\n; @expect AX = 0xFFFF\n; @expect CF = 1"
    }
  ]
}
